# Google Drive — Google Docs export (service accounts have NO personal storage)
# Option A (recommended): Shared Drive folder
#   1. Create a Shared Drive in Google Drive
#   2. Add the service account email (client_email in google-credentials.json) as Content manager
#   3. Create a folder inside it, copy its ID from the URL
 GOOGLE_DRIVE_FOLDER_ID=0ANIoBkW_dZfbUk9PVA
#
# Option B: Workspace domain-wide delegation (impersonate a user with storage)
#   1. Enable domain-wide delegation on the service account in Google Cloud Console
#   2. Authorize the Drive + Docs scopes in Google Admin for the service account client ID
#   3. Set a Workspace user email below (uploads use that user's Drive quota)
# GOOGLE_DRIVE_IMPERSONATE_USER=you@yourworkspace.com

